Implemented atomic inventory reservation in `src/shipping/fulfillment.js`.

Behavior now:
- Checks all required stock before mutating anything.
- Aggregates duplicate SKUs before checking availability.
- Throws `Insufficient stock for <sku>` if any line cannot be fulfilled.
- Leaves inventory and order unchanged on failure.
- Reserves inventory and marks order ready only after all stock is available.

Tests run successfully:

```bash
npm test
```

All tests passed.
